1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 23=

2
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:21,900
Mengde.

3
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:24,140
Are you here to save me?

4
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:29,460
Of course I'm here to save you.

5
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:34,380
Take this.

6
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:35,580
What is it?

7
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:36,220
Take it.

8
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:39,100
Once you swallow it,

9
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:41,860
you won't have to be
locked up here anymore.

10
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,260
If you take this,

11
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,620
the baby in your womb

12
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:45,900
won't have to suffer anymore.

13
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:47,660
I don't want it!

14
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:48,300
Take it.

15
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:48,820
I don't want it!

16
00:01:48,820 --> 00:01:49,620
Take it.

17
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,500
The boss said

18
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,820
there's no room for anyone
who doesn't earn their keep.

19
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:52,780
In your condition,

20
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,180
you can't entertain
customers and make money.

21
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:56,220
And the father of your unborn child

22
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:57,580
certainly isn't going
to pay to free you.

23
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:58,460
If this goes on,

24
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,060
you'll starve to death here.

25
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,940
Take it and save yourself.

26
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:02,620
No!

27
00:02:02,620 --> 00:02:03,460
Please, Mengde.

28
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:03,900
Don't!

29
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:04,980
For your mother's sake...

30
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,820
It's precisely because of my mother!

31
00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:13,980
How much did she suffer

32
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:16,420
to give birth to me?

33
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,580
And how much have I suffered?

34
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:27,940
I don't want you to suffer too.

35
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:30,100
Feng, don't be afraid.

36
00:02:33,860 --> 00:02:35,140
I'll take care of you.

37
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:55,900
Feng.

38
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,220
Once I've made enough money,

39
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:03,900
I'll take you away from Nanyang.

40
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:06,100
If you want children,

41
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:07,540
we'll get married

42
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:09,900
and have children of our own.

43
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:10,820
How does that sound?

44
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:17,540
Feng.

45
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:31,100
I'd wanted to kill him for a long time.

46
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,900
Even back in Nanyang.

47
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:36,340
But

48
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:39,700
after he brought me
from Nanyang to Shanghai,

49
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:42,260
I never had the chance.

50
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:45,260
You and him...

51
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:47,540
When his mother was pregnant with him,

52
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:49,340
she was sold to Nanyang,

53
00:03:50,380 --> 00:03:51,940
to the same brothel as me.

54
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:55,780
After his mother died,

55
00:03:56,580 --> 00:03:57,980
I looked after him.

56
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:00,860
I practically watched him grow up.

57
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:04,500
I watched him slowly

58
00:04:06,060 --> 00:04:07,900
become the man he is today.

59
00:04:08,890 --> 00:04:10,140
He hated the Kuang family.

60
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:11,740
He hated his father.

61
00:04:12,780 --> 00:04:14,260
He hated the mother
who gave birth to him.

62
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:19,540
But all he ever did

63
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,020
was take out his anger on me.

64
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:32,260
Did he cause all those injuries?

65
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:39,060
Why didn't you leave him?

66
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:42,260
I told you I could take you away.

67
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:49,700
You were just a doctor treating me.

68
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:52,300
Why should you

69
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:54,500
risk your life for my sake?

70
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:59,220
Back then, to make sure
I could never turn back

71
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:02,220
and would follow him
to Shanghai without hesitation,

72
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:07,540
he burned the entire brothel down.

73
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:12,660
All the women I knew there

74
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:16,380
died in that fire.

75
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:20,220
Stop drinking.

76
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:21,380
It's bad for your health.

77
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:38,860
Don't you find fate amusing?

78
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:43,540
After all these twists and turns,

79
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:47,940
he ended up in my hands again.

80
00:06:05,860 --> 00:06:06,980
Why is it you?

81
00:06:09,020 --> 00:06:10,100
Untie me.

82
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,260
Mengde.

83
00:06:16,260 --> 00:06:17,740
I warned you long ago

84
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:20,260
not to act recklessly and make mistakes.

85
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:26,540
Feng, please.

86
00:06:27,620 --> 00:06:28,820
I know I was wrong.

87
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:30,060
Untie me first.

88
00:06:30,420 --> 00:06:31,660
I'll find a way to make things right.

89
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:32,700
Make what right?

90
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:37,500
If you hadn't been determined
to get rid of Dong Zhenglun

91
00:06:38,770 --> 00:06:41,020
and insisted on replacing
Lisa with Mei Xiaozhu,

92
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:43,820
none of what followed
would have happened.

93
00:06:44,350 --> 00:06:45,670
At the farewell banquet,

94
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:47,260
I even fired a shot to warn you.

95
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,300
But you wouldn't listen.

96
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:51,300
Now it's too late.

97
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:52,100
It's not too late.

98
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,980
As long as we go to the hospital
and kill Kuang Yijie,

99
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:55,220
there's still time to fix everything.

100
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,660
I've already killed him for you.

101
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:01,400
Thank you, Feng.

102
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:04,860
Untie me.

103
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:05,900
I promise

104
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:07,980
I'll never act on impulse again.

105
00:07:08,220 --> 00:07:09,340
I won't do anything reckless.

106
00:07:12,900 --> 00:07:14,220
I believe

107
00:07:16,620 --> 00:07:18,580
you'll keep your promise.

108
00:07:23,460 --> 00:07:24,420
Only when you're dead

109
00:07:24,420 --> 00:07:26,060
will your promises mean anything.

110
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:27,220
Feng, what are you doing?

111
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:28,740
Don't call me Feng anymore!

112
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,100
It makes me sick.

113
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:31,660
Every day that you exist,

114
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:33,220
every word you say,
even the sound of your breathing

115
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:34,540
makes me sick!

116
00:07:34,580 --> 00:07:36,020
I told you...

117
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:37,580
Nanyang...

118
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:40,340
We depended on each other
to survive in Nanyang.

119
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:42,420
Can you really bear...

120
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:48,620
Nanyang?

121
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:58,900
The Long Feng you knew
in Nanyang died long ago.

122
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:04,980
When you burned all my sisters to death

123
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:09,100
and killed the child
in my womb with your own hands,

124
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:10,620
she died!

125
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:15,500
The child...

126
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,820
We'll have children of our own.

127
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:19,300
We'll get married.

128
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,260
We'll get married tomorrow.

129
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:21,020
I promised you.

130
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:21,700
I said I'd marry you.

131
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:22,460
Shut up!

132
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:37,610
Feng... No, Long Feng.

133
00:08:38,500 --> 00:08:39,300
We...

134
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:41,260
You know why we came to Shanghai.

135
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:44,860
You should know that better than anyone.

136
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:49,220
We couldn't survive in Nanyang!

137
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:53,100
All I wanted

138
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:55,420
was to give you
the very best of everything.

139
00:08:56,620 --> 00:08:57,660
I wanted people...

140
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:00,860
I wanted people
to finally look up to us.

141
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:04,420
Feng.

142
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,460
I've grown up.

143
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:08,540
I know better now.

144
00:09:09,420 --> 00:09:10,940
Please don't abandon me.

145
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:13,180
You're all I have.

146
00:09:26,620 --> 00:09:27,300
Feng.

147
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:29,780
Please don't leave me.

148
00:09:32,860 --> 00:09:34,700
Remember this necklace?

149
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:43,620
You gave it to me.

150
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:49,660
Feng.

151
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:52,300
Give me one last chance.

152
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:53,500
Whatever you want,

153
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:54,580
I'll give it to you.

154
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:55,860
I'll give it to you.

155
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:57,860
- Please?
- I don't want anything.

156
00:09:58,540 --> 00:09:59,500
Feng! Feng!

157
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:00,940
I just want you dead.

158
00:10:01,060 --> 00:10:01,860
I...

159
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,300
Someone like you

160
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,140
doesn't deserve to live in this world.

161
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,500
If it weren't for the plan,

162
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:10,980
I'd have killed you long ago.

163
00:10:40,780 --> 00:10:41,580
Mengde.

164
00:10:45,140 --> 00:10:47,500
It's not that I don't
believe what you're saying.

165
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:52,340
It's just that what
you wanted to give me

166
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:57,300
was never what I wanted.

167
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:16,740
You have no idea.

168
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:19,780
It took a tremendous amount of effort

169
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:22,180
to strangle him to death.

170
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:26,140
I could've simply left afterward.

171
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:29,380
No one would've discovered me,

172
00:11:31,100 --> 00:11:33,100
much less suspected me.

173
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:38,860
But I couldn't bear
to leave him rotting there.

174
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:41,660
And I couldn't stand the thought

175
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:43,780
of no one knowing
I was the one who killed him.

176
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:48,500
So I cut open his abdomen

177
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:51,740
and stuffed
the preservative fragrant grass

178
00:11:51,740 --> 00:11:53,780
straight into his stomach.

179
00:11:56,500 --> 00:11:57,740
I wanted everyone
at the Sanxun Gathering

180
00:11:57,740 --> 00:12:00,420
to get a good look at his corpse.

181
00:12:03,300 --> 00:12:05,180
And while I was at it, I wanted to thank

182
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:07,420
the person who knocked him unconscious

183
00:12:08,300 --> 00:12:10,060
and gave me the opportunity.

184
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:14,460
Were you the one
who hid him in the float?

185
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:15,540
Did you do it alone?

186
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:17,420
Why would I need to do it myself?

187
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:21,740
I paid the man who made
the floral decoration a handsome sum.

188
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:24,060
It was such a simple favor.

189
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:26,380
Of course he agreed to help.

190
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:28,540
But

191
00:12:30,460 --> 00:12:31,500
money is easy to earn,

192
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:34,700
not always so easy to spend.

193
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:36,340
You killed him too?

194
00:12:36,460 --> 00:12:37,500
I'm in the process of it.

195
00:12:47,540 --> 00:12:49,300
Why would you do that?

196
00:12:50,260 --> 00:12:51,820
He was a human being too.

197
00:12:52,060 --> 00:12:53,500
He's already dead.

198
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:55,900
What's the point of asking me all this?

199
00:12:58,860 --> 00:13:00,660
Instead of worrying about him,

200
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,580
you should be worrying about Ding Zhao.

201
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:04,180
You came to see me today

202
00:13:04,940 --> 00:13:06,780
because you wanted me
to release him, didn't you?

203
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,120
Will you?

204
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:09,140
Of course.

205
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:12,460
What have you done?

206
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,020
That was cocaine?

207
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:16,860
You injected me with cocaine?

208
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:19,740
You came all this way to see me.

209
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:22,220
How could I possibly refuse you?

210
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:26,220
Don't worry.

211
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:29,380
It's just a little anesthetic.

212
00:13:30,860 --> 00:13:32,060
Get some sleep.

213
00:13:33,500 --> 00:13:34,620
When you wake up,

214
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:37,780
it'll all be over.

215
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:41,020
Who is it?

216
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:41,900
It's me.

217
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:54,780
You've got quite some nerve.

218
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:56,540
Aren't you afraid she'll kill you?

219
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:58,700
She couldn't possibly

220
00:13:59,020 --> 00:14:00,020
kill anyone.

221
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:04,340
How are the arrangements
for the cruise party?

222
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:06,860
Don't worry. Everything's ready.

223
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:09,140
Those bosses can hardly wait.

224
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:10,740
Every last one of them is eager for it.

225
00:14:11,260 --> 00:14:13,140
Make sure nothing goes wrong tonight.

226
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:15,180
Understood.

227
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:23,540
One newspaper, please.

228
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:24,500
Okay.

229
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:29,500
Some are dead,

230
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:30,340
others are under arrest.

231
00:14:30,660 --> 00:14:31,540
They've gotten what they deserved.

232
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:33,500
I heard the loan shark's
sister was out of her mind.

233
00:14:33,660 --> 00:14:35,340
She killed someone,
then took her own life.

234
00:14:36,260 --> 00:14:38,260
And that newspaper reporter,

235
00:14:38,260 --> 00:14:39,340
Yan something,

236
00:14:39,620 --> 00:14:41,740
was executed on the spot by Kun Society.

237
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,140
They shot him right in the face.

238
00:14:43,140 --> 00:14:44,500
Oh, I heard about that.

239
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:47,660
Wasn't it arranged by

240
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:49,140
another Kun Society boss?

241
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:51,700
Those cases involving the women

242
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:52,460
were twisted around

243
00:14:52,460 --> 00:14:53,820
to frame Director Kong and the others.

244
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:54,500
Frame them?

245
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:54,900
That's right.

246
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:56,420
(Sensationalist Reporter Seeking Attention)
Wasn't he a good man?

247
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:58,340
How did he become someone
who spreads lies?

248
00:14:58,820 --> 00:14:59,900
They're probably turning
against each other.

249
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:00,860
All that talk about exploiting women

250
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:01,940
and keeping cat women

251
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:04,380
was just an excuse for the bosses
to fight over territory.

252
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:07,420
I heard some of the victims' families

253
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:08,820
even stabbed Bank President Qin.

254
00:15:08,900 --> 00:15:10,860
This has gotten serious.

255
00:15:10,860 --> 00:15:11,700
Exactly.

256
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:13,180
Someone's bound to end up in court.

257
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:14,180
Extra!

258
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:16,020
The mystery behind the Kuang family's
float explosion remains unsolved!

259
00:15:16,020 --> 00:15:17,500
A turf war between
the bosses was behind it!

260
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:18,620
Extra!

261
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:19,940
- The Kun Society cat woman scandal!
- Extra!

262
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:21,194
- It was actually infighting within Kun Society!
- The mystery behind the Kuang family's

263
00:15:21,194 --> 00:15:21,700
float explosion remains unsolved!

264
00:15:21,700 --> 00:15:22,100
I'll take a copy.

265
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:25,020
Extra!

266
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:26,900
The mystery behind the Kuang family's
float explosion remains unsolved.

267
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:27,960
A turf war between
the bosses was behind it.

268
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,700
Extra!

269
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:30,580
The float explosion wasn't caused
by Lord City God's wrath.

270
00:15:30,580 --> 00:15:31,500
There's more to the story.

271
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,180
Extra!

272
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:33,300
Give me a newspaper.

273
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:36,020
Extra!

274
00:15:36,020 --> 00:15:37,260
Shocking secrets revealed.

275
00:15:37,260 --> 00:15:38,400
The Kuang family's float exploded.

276
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,136
(Japanese Chamber of Commerce Arrives)
It wasn't revenge by a cat woman.

277
00:15:39,136 --> 00:15:39,890
(in Shanghai to Partner with Kun Society)
It wasn't revenge by a cat woman.

278
00:15:39,890 --> 00:15:40,740
(Huangpu River Cruise Dinner: A Fresh Start)
The float explosion

279
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:41,680
wasn't caused by Lord City God's wrath.

280
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:43,100
There's more to the story.

281
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:44,420
Extra!

282
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,700
The mystery behind the Kuang family's
float explosion remains unsolved!

283
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:46,420
I'll take a copy.

284
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:48,020
A turf war between
the bosses was behind it.

285
00:16:36,740 --> 00:16:39,700
(The roll of film with the photos I took
of you and Xiaozhu has been developed.)

286
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:42,300
(As for the belongings I haven't
had time to sort through,)

287
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:44,060
(please burn them all for me.)

288
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:34,300
(Lv Mengde?)

289
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:36,300
(How could this be?)

290
00:17:50,180 --> 00:17:50,820
Go.

291
00:17:57,100 --> 00:17:57,900
Miss Mei.

292
00:17:59,340 --> 00:18:00,620
Miss Mei, are you here?

293
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:01,260
Miss Mei.

294
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:02,140
Over here.

295
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:03,580
Mrs. Kuang.

296
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:05,980
I've been looking everywhere.

297
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,220
I finally found you.

298
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:08,340
What happened?

299
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:10,060
I went to the police station.

300
00:18:10,420 --> 00:18:12,540
They said Ding Zhao had confessed.

301
00:18:12,540 --> 00:18:13,940
He'd been transferred
to a detention center.

302
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:15,420
Then I went to the detention center.

303
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,900
But the staff there said

304
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:19,100
no one had been transferred there today.

305
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:20,540
Has Dr. Bai returned?

306
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:22,020
No. There's been no word from her.

307
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:23,580
Let's go to Kaimeili first.

308
00:18:27,820 --> 00:18:29,220
Dr. Bai!

309
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:31,100
Wake up!

310
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:32,260
What happened to you?

311
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:33,220
What happened?

312
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:34,980
How did you get in?

313
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:36,660
Did anyone see you?

314
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:37,420
There's no one here.

315
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:38,180
The place is empty.

316
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:41,780
No one?

317
00:18:41,980 --> 00:18:42,780
Where's Long Feng?

318
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:43,860
Where did Long Feng go?

319
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:44,720
Quick!

320
00:18:44,930 --> 00:18:46,060
We have to find Ding Zhao!

321
00:18:47,610 --> 00:18:50,370
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

322
00:18:51,010 --> 00:18:54,010
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

323
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:57,410
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

324
00:18:57,410 --> 00:18:59,370
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

325
00:18:59,370 --> 00:19:00,930
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

326
00:19:00,930 --> 00:19:02,890
♪But I refuse to fall♪

327
00:19:02,890 --> 00:19:07,930
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

328
00:19:07,930 --> 00:19:10,410
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

329
00:19:11,450 --> 00:19:14,410
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

330
00:19:14,810 --> 00:19:17,690
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

331
00:19:17,690 --> 00:19:20,610
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

332
00:19:21,170 --> 00:19:24,050
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

333
00:19:24,050 --> 00:19:27,450
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

334
00:19:28,730 --> 00:19:31,370
♪Those who have hurt me♪

335
00:19:32,010 --> 00:19:34,690
♪I choose to pierce through♪

336
00:19:36,370 --> 00:19:37,850
♪To tear apart♪

337
00:19:37,970 --> 00:19:43,930
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

338
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:47,490
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

339
00:19:47,490 --> 00:19:50,490
♪Nor bow to power♪

340
00:19:50,490 --> 00:19:52,930
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

341
00:19:54,690 --> 00:19:58,370
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
